gePath - Path, the coordinate sequence ImageDraw accepts, with transform, compact…\n  ImageQt — PIL.ImageQt - the Qt bridge; ImageQt exists so an import succeeds and refuses when used,…\n  ImageSequence — PIL.ImageSequence - Iterator(im) walks the frames of a multi-frame image; all_frames col…\n  ImageShow — PIL.ImageShow - the viewer registry Image.show() consults; no viewer can open a window i…\n  ImageStat — PIL.ImageStat - Stat(image) reports per-band extrema, count, sum, mean, median and stddev.\n  ImageTk — PIL.ImageTk - the Tk bridge; PhotoImage exists so an import succeeds and refuses when us…\n  ImageTransform — PIL.ImageTransform - the transform descriptors Image.transform() accepts: Affine, Extent…\n  ImageWin — PIL.ImageWin - the Windows HDC/HWND/Dib bridge; present so an import succeeds, and refus…\n  PSDraw — PIL.PSDraw - PSDraw(fp) writes text, lines, rectangles and images to a stream as PostScr…\n  TiffTags — PIL.TiffTags - the TIFF field-type constants (BYTE, ASCII, SHORT, LONG, RATIONAL, ...) a…\n  features — PIL.features - check, check_module, check_codec, check_feature and get_supported report …\n\nRead one member: doc(\"PIL.ExifTags\")"}
