 {:name "fontTools", :kind "module", :text "WOFF2 to TTF: `fontTools.ttLib.woff2.decompress(input, output)` plus `brotli.decompress(bytes)`. Not supported: `brotli.compress`, WOFF1, `TTFont`, the wider fontTools API.\n\nModules:\n  ttLib — fontTools.ttLib: `woff2.decompress(input, output)` turns a WOFF2 web font into a TTF. TT…\n\nRead one member: doc(\"fontTools.ttLib\")"}
