 {:name "ls", :kind "function", :text "ls(paths='.', depth=1, is_hidden=False): directory contents from the host's ignore-aware walk, rendered as a compact printable STRING. ls(dir) -> a `path  Nd Nf` header then one tree line per entry, directories first then alphabetical: a directory is `name/` (with its child count once depth expanded it), a file is `name  size` (`812`, `7.2k`, `2.1M`); ls([dir, ...]) -> one such section per directory in request order, blank-line separated. Dotfiles need is_hidden=True and gitignored entries are never listed. Raises NotADirectoryError for a file, FileNotFoundError naming the nearest existing directory, PermissionError when an extension protects it. A path is a str or a pathlib.Path.", :call "ls(paths='.', depth=1, is_hidden=False)"}
 {:name "matplotlib", :kind "module", :text "`matplotlib.pyplot` and OO subset with native PNG and ASCII renderers (line/scatter/bar/hist/fill/step/pie/box/image, `mpl_toolkits.mplot3d`); `show()` is inline PNG or ASCII, `savefig` writes PNG or ASCII text. Not supported: animation, full rcParams theming.\n\nFunctions:\n  get_backend() — Name the active backend, always the headless Agg renderer of this sandbox.\n  rc(*a, **k) — Set rc parameters (accepted; this renderer keeps its own defaults).\n  rcdefaults(*a, **k) — Restore default rc parameters (accepted; this renderer keeps its own defaults).\n  use(backend=None, *a, **k) — Select a backend (accepted and ignored: plots always render headless through Agg).\n\nModules:\n  animation — vis matplotlib.animation compat subset.\n  artist — vis matplotlib.artist compat subset.\n  axes — vis matplotlib.axes compat subset.\n  axis — vis matplotlib.axis compat subset.\n  backends — matplotlib.backends: the Agg backend this sandbox renders PNG through.\n  cm — matplotlib.cm: colormaps by name — cm.viridis, cm.plasma, get_cmap('coolwarm').\n  collections — vis matplotlib.collections compat subset.\n  colorbar — vis matplotlib.colorbar compat subset.\n  colormaps — matplotlib.cm: colormaps by name — cm.viridis, cm.plasma, get_cmap('coolwarm').\n  colors — vis matplotlib.colors compat subset.\n  container — vis matplotlib.container compat subset.\n  dates — vis matplotlib.dates compat subset.\n  figure — vis matplotlib.figure compat subset.\n  font_manager — vis matplotlib.font_manager compat subset.\n  gridspec — vis matplotlib.gridspec compat subset.\n  image — vis matplotlib.image compat subset.\n  legend — vis matplotlib.legend compat subset.\n  legend_handler — vis matplotlib.legend_handler compat subset.\n  lines — vis matplotlib.lines compat subset.\n  markers — vis matplotlib.markers compat subset.\n  offsetbox — vis matplotlib.offsetbox compat subset.\n  patches — vis matplotlib.patches compat subset.\n  path — vis matplotlib.path compat subset.\n  patheffects — vis matplotlib.patheffects compat subset.\n  pyplot — vis imaging-backed matplotlib.pyplot subset.\n  spines — vis matplotlib.spines compat subset.\n  style — matplotlib.style: style.use(name) — accepted and ignored by this sandbox renderer.\n  text — vis matplotlib.text compat subset.\n  ticker — vis matplotlib.ticker compat subset.\n  transforms — vis matplotlib.transforms compat subset.\n\nRead one member: doc(\"matplotlib.animation\")"}
