 {:name "nippy", :kind "module", :text "`nippy_decode`/`nippy_encode` round-trip trusted Vis Nippy bytes and plain Python data; Vectorz vectors decode as lists. Not supported: exact Clojure type preservation, Java Serializable fallback, encryption, untrusted input.\n\nClasses:\n  NippyError(...) — Raised when nippy_encode/nippy_decode cannot encode or decode a value.\n\nFunctions:\n  decode(data) — Read trusted Vis Nippy bytes (or their base64 text) back into plain Python data.\n  dumps(value) — Serialize plain Python data to Vis Nippy bytes the Clojure host reads back.\n  encode(value) — Serialize plain Python data to Vis Nippy bytes the Clojure host reads back.\n  loads(data) — Read trusted Vis Nippy bytes (or their base64 text) back into plain Python data.\n\nRead one member: doc(\"nippy.NippyError\")"}
 {:name "nippy.NippyError", :kind "class", :text "Raised when nippy_encode/nippy_decode cannot encode or decode a value.", :call "NippyError(...)"}
