 {:name "tabulate", :kind "module", :text "`tabulate`-compatible, pure Python: plain/simple/github/pipe/grid/fancy_grid/rst/tsv/html. No exotic formats or color.\n\nClasses:\n  DataRow(begin: str, sep: str, end: str, escape_map: dict = None) -> None — Row separator description used by a table format: begin, sep, end characters.\n  JupyterHTMLStr(...) — Wrap the string with a _repr_html_ method so that Jupyter\n\nFunctions:\n  simple_separated_format(separator) — Construct a simple TableFormat with columns separated by a separator.\n  tabulate(tabular_data, headers=(), tablefmt='simple', floatfmt='g', intfmt='', numalign='default', stralign='default', missingval='', showindex='default', disable_numparse=False, colglobalalign=None, colalign=None, preserve_whitespace=False, maxcolwidths=None, headersglobalalign=None, headersalign=None, rowalign=None, maxheadercolwidths=None, break_long_words=True, break_on_hyphens=True) — Format a fixed width table for pretty printing.\n\nData:\n  GITHUB_ESCAPE_RULES\n  LATEX_ESCAPE_RULES\n  MIN_PADDING\n  PRESERVE_WHITESPACE\n  SEPARATING_LINE\n  WIDE_CHARS_MODE\n  multiline_formats\n  tabulate_formats\n  wcwidth\n\nRead one member: doc(\"tabulate.DataRow\")"}
