 {:name "zoneinfo", :kind "module", :text "`zoneinfo.ZoneInfo` over the JVM java.time zone database — 600+ IANA zones, DST-correct, no tzdata files on disk. Part of the vis time shim; see `doc(\"tzdata\")`.\n\nClasses:\n  ZoneInfo(key) — IANA time zone usable as a datetime tzinfo: ZoneInfo('Europe/Warsaw'), read from the JVM…\n  ZoneInfoNotFoundError(...) — Raised when ZoneInfo is asked for a zone name the database does not carry.\n\nFunctions:\n  available_timezones() — Return the set of every IANA time-zone name this sandbox can load.\n  reset_tzpath(to=None) — Accept and ignore a tzpath override: zones come from the JVM database, not a path.\n\nData:\n  TZPATH\n\nRead one member: doc(\"zoneinfo.TZPATH\")"}
